"Professional e-commerce fashion photograph of an original fictional adult woman, 24 years old. She is not a real or identifiable person and must not resemble one. If any instruction below conflicts, follow the earlier section.

Garment: Satin halter top (top, black). Satin halter top with a deep V neckline, gathered bust, ruched waistband and open back. Reproduce the garment exactly as shown in the garment reference images: construction, seams, neckline, closures, length, colour, print, texture and transparency. Do not add, remove or redesign any element. Halter neckline and neck fastening exactly as in the packshot. The back is open as in the back packshot; front views must not reveal back construction that is not visible from the front. Satin sheen follows the folds of the fabric; soft highlights, no plastic look.

Identity: the same woman as in the identity reference images. Straight brows, narrow jaw, defined cheekbones;dark-brown eyes; olive skin; long straight dark-brown hair. Keep face shape, features, skin tone and hair colour identical to the references. Hair styled: sleek, tucked behind the ears.

Body: 178 cm tall, EU size 36, proportions exactly as in the full-body reference. The garment fits as it would on EU size 36: natural tension and folds where it meets the body.

Straight-on front view, camera at chest height, short telephoto look (about 85 mm full-frame equivalent), no perspective distortion. Crop from just above the head to mid-thigh. The entire front of the garment is visible and unobstructed.

Background: seamless flat neutral grey, RGB 241,241,241, no gradient, no vignette, no props. Lighting: soft, high frontal key light with low contrast and soft natural shadows. Colour: neutral, true to the garment; blacks keep detail. Retouching: clean but natural, real skin texture, pores and small asymmetries kept; no smoothing or plastic look.

Pose: Standing square to the camera, weight evenly on both feet, feet hip-width apart, arms hanging relaxed at the sides with open, softly curved fingers, shoulders relaxed and level, head straight.

Expression: Neutral, relaxed expression, lips closed, calm direct gaze into the camera.

Styling (secondary, must not draw attention from the garment): bottoms: straight light-blue jeans.

Avoid: text, logos, watermarks or brand marks not present on the garment; any change to garment colour, length, neckline, closures or transparency; extra garments or layers covering the product; smoothed, waxy or plastic-looking skin; extra, missing or fused fingers; distorted hands or limbs; props, furniture or background texture."
`;
